	(text "NOTES (Rev 1.1)\n1. Set U1 (XL4015) to 5.0 V and U2 (MP1584) to 3.3 V BEFORE connecting any load.\n2. Check U2 module IN+/OUT+ and J2 INA226 pin order against the module silkscreen before soldering.\n3. Check the INA226 module shunt: R100 reads only 0.82 A full scale. Use R010-R020.\n4. J26 PYRO_ARM: no shorting plug except when deliberately firing. Drive PYRO_FIRE from a Pi GPIO 9-27 (boot pull-down).\n5. TODO D1: Vwm > panel Voc, Vc < 28 V (CN3722 max). TODO F1: about 1.5x panel Isc. TODO F4: AUX load (track max 2 A).\n6. Q3 IRLZ44N is specified at Vgs 4-5 V; at 3.3 V gate drive check it fully enhances at the pyro current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c23578b-6cd4-408b-9af2-83a587d51839")
	)
	(text "PYRO ARM: remove-before-flight plug.\nOpen = pyro cannot fire."
